msgid "Flight of the Amazon Queen (1995) is a comic Indiana Jones-style point-and-click adventure in the Amazon. Pilot Joe King crash-lands in the jungle and stumbles into a mad scientist's plot to turn humans into dinosaurs."
msgstr "《Flight of the Amazon Queen》(1995年)是一款印第安納·瓊斯風格的喜劇點擊式冒險遊戲,故事發生在亞馬遜。飛行員喬·金在叢林中迫降,意外撞上一名瘋狂科學家把人類變成恐龍的陰謀。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_librequake.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Founded in 2019, LibreQuake is the second attempt at creating a free Quake content replacement, succeeding the Open Quartz project which started in 2000 but stalled. Like Freedoom for DOOM, it provides a complete standalone game that requires no commercial data files from id Software."
msgstr "LibreQuake 成立於 2019 年,是第二次嘗試打造免費的 Quake 內容替代品,前一個是 2000 年啟動但後來停滯的 Open Quartz 專案。就像 DOOM 的 Freedoom 一樣,它是一款完整的獨立遊戲,不需要 id Software 的任何商業資料檔案。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedm.html.heex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "FreeDM contains no monsters in its entire mapset — it's purely designed for deathmatch combat, unlike Phase 1 and Phase 2 which are single-player campaigns."
msgstr "FreeDM 整套地圖中完全沒有怪物——它純粹為死亡競賽而設計,不像第 1 階段和第 2 階段是單人戰役。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedm.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "FreeDM is the deathmatch-only component of the Freedoom project — 32 arena-style maps with no monsters, designed purely for player-vs-player combat. Unlike Phase 1 and Phase 2, which are single-player campaigns, FreeDM focuses on tight, weapon-dense arena layouts."
msgstr "FreeDM 是 Freedoom 專案中僅限死亡競賽的部分——32 張沒有怪物的競技場式地圖,完全為玩家對玩家的戰鬥而設計。不同於屬於單人戰役的第 1 階段和第 2 階段,FreeDM 著重於緊湊、武器密集的競技場配置。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom2.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Freedoom Phase 2 replaces DOOM II with 32 levels of original content — new sprites, textures, sounds, and music created entirely by the open source community. The Super Shotgun is included, along with all weapon and enemy equivalents from the original game."
msgstr "Freedoom 第 2 階段以 32 個關卡的原創內容取代 DOOM II——全新的精靈圖、材質、音效和音樂,全部由開源社群製作。內含超級散彈槍,以及原版遊戲中所有武器和敵人的對應版本。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_freedoom1.html.heex:92
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Freedoom has not yet reached version 1.0 and remains under active development since 2001 — making it one of the longest-running open source game projects."
msgstr "Freedoom 尚未推出 1.0 版,自 2001 年起持續積極開發,是執行時間最久的開源遊戲專案之一。"

