msgstr "各種武器的效果不一"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein.html.heex:84
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein_3d.html.heex:94
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Wolfenstein 3D used raycasting (not true 3D) — all walls are the same height and floors are flat. The 3D effect is an optical illusion."
msgstr "Wolfenstein 3D 使用光線投射(並非真正的 3D)——所有牆壁高度相同,地板也是平直的。3D 效果其實是一種視覺錯覺。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm_lure.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You play Diermot, a peasant who must free the village of Turnvale from the sorceress Selena and her army of Skorl. The game reached #1 on the British Gallup charts at the beginning of July 1992 and remained in the Top 20 for most of the year. Released as freeware on April 1, 2003. Runs on ScummVM compiled to WebAssembly."
msgstr ""
"你扮演Diermot,一個農民 他必須釋放Turnvale村 從女巫Selena和她的軍隊Skorl。 "
"遊戲於1992年7月初在英國蓋洛普圖表上達到#1,並在當年的大部分時間裏一直保持前20名. 2003年4月1日作爲免費軟件發佈. 運行在編譯到 Web "
"Assembly 的 ScummVM 上 。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom_shareware.html.heex:100
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "id Software estimated only 1% of shareware downloaders bought the full game — yet this generated $100,000 per day in initial revenue, selling in one day what Wolfenstein 3D had sold in one month."
msgstr "id Software 估計只有 1% 的共享軟體下載者購買了完整版遊戲——但這仍然帶來每天 $100,000 的初期收入,一天賣出的量相當於 Wolfenstein 3D 一個月的銷量。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein_3d.html.heex:88
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "id Software purchased the Wolfenstein trademark for just $5,000 in mid-April 1992, weeks before the game launched."
msgstr "id Software 在 1992 年 4 月中旬,也就是遊戲上市前幾週,僅以 $5,000 買下了 Wolfenstein 商標。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2.html.heex:88
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake2_shareware.html.heex:103
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "id Software released the Quake II source code under GPL in 2001, leading to dozens of enhanced source ports including Yamagi Quake II used here."
msgstr "id Software 於 2001 年以 GPL 授權釋出 Quake II 原始碼,催生了數十個增強版原始碼移植版本,包括此處使用的 Yamagi Quake II。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_wolfenstein.html.heex:96
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "id Software released the full Wolfenstein 3D source code in 1995, spawning decades of source ports and mods."
msgstr "id Software 於 1995 年釋出完整的 Wolfenstein 3D 原始碼,催生了數十年來的各種原始碼移植版本與模組。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— 32 deathmatch-focused arena maps. BSD license."
msgstr "— 32張以死鬥為主的競技場地圖。BSD 授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A Viking-themed total conversion with hand-drawn pixel art. Axes, bows, and runic magic. Freeware."
msgstr "— 以維京為主題的全面改造作品,搭配手繪像素藝術。有斧頭、弓箭和符文魔法。免費軟體。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:32
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A complete free replacement for DOOM II. 32 levels with the Super Shotgun. Compatible with community PWAD mods. BSD license."
msgstr "— 完全免費的 DOOM II 替代品。32 個關卡,附超級霰彈槍。相容社群製作的 PWAD 模組。BSD 授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_quake.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A complete free replacement for Quake. Original levels, art, and music under BSD license."
msgstr "— 完全免費的 Quake 替代品。原創關卡、美術與音樂,採用 BSD 授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A complete free replacement for Ultimate DOOM. 4 episodes, 36 levels with original art and music. BSD license."
msgstr "— 完全免費的 Ultimate DOOM 替代品。4 個章節、36 個關卡,附原創美術與音樂。BSD 授權。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:54
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— A cyberpunk total conversion with new weapons, enemies, and levels. Standalone v1.2 IWAD. Freeware."
msgstr "— 賽博龐克風格的全面改造作品,有新武器、新敵人和新關卡。獨立版 v1.2 IWAD。免費軟體。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_scummvm.html.heex:122
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "— Adventure games reward thorough exploration. Look at, pick up, and talk to everything you can."
msgstr "— 冒險遊戲獎勵徹底的探索。對所有能看的、能撿的、能交談的對象都試一試。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_doom.html.heex:80
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_arcade_halflife.html.heex:32
